<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A striped umbrella with a beach ball beside it, under an orange kite.

  Drawn over ic_beach_scene_base in the same 260x100 frame, so the two line up
  exactly. The kite belongs to this layer rather than the base: Round 8 flies a
  different one over every scene, so it changes with the props.

  Sizes come from the design directly: the frame's height matches the design
  card's, so one percent of the card's width is two units here. Only the ground
  line is moved - props stand at y 89 rather than the design's y 98, to stay
  inside the band that survives a centreCrop into a 3:1 list row.
-->
